When for_each is used in two resource give reference like shown below

service_account = google_service_account.service_account["composer_sa"].email

Note: Here composer_sa is input key resource in dev.tfvars  

Ex:

service_accounts = {
  composer_sa = {
    composer_service_account = "composer-sa"
    display_name             = "This service is using for test composer"
  }
}
